abstract: >
  Simulation code reproducing all figures, tables and analyses of the TRACE
  study (OMICS-SIM cohort, adversarial robustness/circularity test, label-free
  calibration surrogate validation, baseline comparison, and provenance
  sensitivity). All data are simulated; no human-subject data are used.
